  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "On November 8, 2026, a Super Puma VH-HGM helicopter, chartered by the National Disaster Management Agency (BNPB) for forest and land fire suppression, crashed into the Barito River in South Kalimantan. The aircraft was reportedly engaged in water-bombing activities at the time of the accident. Official reports indicate that while two foreign crew members were rescued, one Indonesian national remains missing, prompting an active search and rescue operation in the area. The cause of the crash currently remains under investigation by the relevant authorities. Despite the disruption caused by the incident, the BNPB has confirmed that fire mitigation efforts in the region are ongoing and will not be halted. The incident has drawn significant media attention due to the high-profile nature of fire-fighting operations in the region.",
